      "id": "claim_982785d0fd074cf9afca2ef0e4673dd2",
      "statement": "The public Starlark surface is three symbols: yarn_binary re-exported from yarn/defs.bzl, the yarn module extension re-exported from yarn/extensions.bzl, each a thin rebinding of a private implementation, and YarnNodeModulesInfo defined in yarn/providers.bzl.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://yarn/defs.bzl",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:f5df013186ee1bd9c3cee980a02509a055dd590de89dce93d1e523a0a353c47d"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://yarn/extensions.bzl",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:5d8bc386121e602b68abbb534c35b4a01a99dcae16a247a3db139b5e7844a503"
